before Remote Chain Configuration , there sould be a dropdown which should show a dropdown with 2 options , Custom and available chains :

if user selects custom then it should sho all these options RPC URL , Teleporter Manager Address
 , Min Teleporter Version ...

but if user chooses available chains , user should be able to select from a list of token remote chains he gets from this :
curl --location 'http://localhost:3002/deploy/ictt'

